  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "The NHS take on the classic LBT class: squats, lunges, calf raises, bridges, crunches, obliques and back raises with no equipment. Most moves are two sets of 15 to 24 reps and it counts towards the weekly strength target. Hold a wall for the calf raises or add water bottles to make them harder. Warm up first with the NHS 6-minute warm-up (nhs-6-min-warm-up) and finish with the 5-minute stretch (nhs-5-min-cool-down-stretch).",
